    "confirmed_root_cause": "performance_patch.dll caps sample_profiler interval at 100 ms (0x10036590), sleeps 100 ms per iteration (0x10037494), yet computes max_sample_qpc = (qpc_freq * 50) / 1000 at 0x10037457..0x1003747b and clamps measured delta_qpc to max_sample_qpc at 0x100374cd..0x100374d9. Every 100 ms sleep sample is therefore recorded with 50 ms of QPC weight, halving reported ms/day sampled."
  },
